{
    "type": "page",
    "title": "图表交互示例",
    "subTitle": "ECharts + 多层弹窗演示 (已修复交互数据透传问题)",
    "titleClassName": "text-center",
    "bodyClassName": "p-3",
    "style": {
        "backgroundColor": "#f7f8fa"
    },
    "css": {
        ".cxd-Page-title": {
            "text-align": "center !important",
            "width": "100%",
            "display": "block",
            "margin-bottom": "6px",
            "margin-top": "10px",
            "font-size": "22px",
            "font-weight": "600",
            "color": "#1d1d1f"
        },
        ".cxd-Page-subTitle": {
            "text-align": "center !important",
            "width": "100%",
            "display": "block",
            "color": "#86868b",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "font-size": "13px",
            "margin-bottom": "15px",
            "margin-top": "0"
        }
    },
    "body": [
        {
            "type": "tpl",
            "tpl": "<div style='margin-bottom: 12px;'><div style='background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #d9d9d9; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px 24px; line-height: 1.7;'><div style='color: #1d1d1f; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 18px; padding-left: 12px; border-left: 4px solid #1890ff;'>定义与分类</div><div style='margin-bottom: 20px;'><div style='color: #1890ff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px;'>风险定义</div><div style='color: #333; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: justify;'>缴存异常风险是指公积金缴存单位因缴款不符合法定规范，或未正常缴纳、缴款异常中断等导致的公积金合规性风险。</div></div></div></div>"
        },
        {
            "type": "panel",
            "title": "<div style='padding-left: 12px; border-left: 4px solid #1890ff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; color: #1d1d1f;'>风险分布分析</div>",
            "className": "m-b-none",
            "bodyClassName": "p-4",
            "style": {
                "boxShadow": "0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
                "borderRadius": "8px",
                "border": "1px solid #f0f0f0"
            },
            "body": {
                "type": "grid",
                "align": "middle",
                "columns": [
                    {
                        "md": 8,
                        "body": [
                            {
                                "type": "chart",
                                "api": {
                                    "url": "/api/demo/chart/risk-pie",
                                    "method": "get",
                                    "adaptor": "const option = payload.data || {}; if (option.series && option.series[0]) { option.series[0].radius = ['50%', '70%']; option.series[0].emphasis = { scale: true, scaleSize: 10 }; option.series[0].itemStyle = { borderRadius: 8, borderColor: '#fff', borderWidth: 2 }; } option.legend = { orient: 'horizontal', bottom: '0', left: 'center', icon: 'circle', itemWidth: 14, itemHeight: 14, textStyle: { fontSize: 13, color: '#666' } }; return { ...payload, data: option };"
                                },
                                "height": 380,
                                "clickAction": {
                                    "actionType": "dialog",
                                    "dialog": {
                                        "title": "${selectedName}客户清册",
                                        "size": "xl",
                                        "actions": [
                                            {
                                                "type": "button",
                                                "label": "关闭",
                                                "actionType": "close"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "data": {
                                            "selectedId": "${data.itemId}",
                                            "selectedName": "${data.name}"
                                        },
                                        "body": {
                                            "type": "service",
                                            "api": {
                                                "method": "get",
                                                "url": "/api/demo/risk-list/${selectedId}",
                                                "adaptor": "return payload;"
                                            },
                                            "body": {
                                                "type": "table",
                                                "affixHeader": true,
                                                "columns": [
                                                    {
                                                        "name": "id",
                                                        "label": "ID",
                                                        "width": 60
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "name": "customer_name",
                                                        "label": "客户姓名"
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "name": "amount",
                                                        "label": "贷款金额",
                                                        "type": "tpl",
                                                        "tpl": "¥${amount | number:0,0}"
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "name": "overdue_days",
                                                        "label": "逾期天数",
                                                        "type": "mapping",
                                                        "map": {
                                                            "*": "<span class='label label-${overdue_days > 60 ? \"danger\" : overdue_days > 30 ? \"warning\" : \"success\"}'>${overdue_days}天</span>"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "name": "risk_score",
                                                        "label": "风险评分",
                                                        "type": "progress",
                                                        "map": {
                                                            "*": {
                                                                "value": "${risk_score}",
                                                                "color": "${risk_score >= 80 ? 'danger' : risk_score >= 50 ? 'warning' : 'success'}"
                                                            }
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "name": "status",
                                                        "label": "处理状态",
                                                        "type": "mapping",
                                                        "map": {
                                                            "pending": "<span class='label label-warning'>待处理</span>",
                                                            "processing": "<span class='label label-info'>处理中</span>",
                                                            "completed": "<span class='label label-success'>已完成</span>"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "operation",
                                                        "label": "操作",
                                                        "width": 180,
                                                        "buttons": [
                                                            {
                                                                "type": "button",
                                                                "label": "详情",
                                                                "level": "link",
                                                                "icon": "fa fa-eye",
                                                                "actionType": "dialog",
                                                                "dialog": {
                                                                    "title": "客户详细信息 - ${customer_name}",
                                                                    "size": "lg",
                                                                    "body": {
                                                                        "type": "form",
                                                                        "mode": "horizontal",
                                                                        "wrapWithPanel": false,
                                                                        "initApi": {
                                                                            "method": "get",
                                                                            "url": "/api/demo/customer/${id}"
                                                                        },
                                                                        "body": [
                                                                            {
                                                                                "type": "static",
                                                                                "name": "id",
                                                                                "label": "客户ID"
                                                                            },
                                                                            {
                                                                                "type": "input-text",
                                                                                "name": "customer_name",
                                                                                "label": "客户姓名",
                                                                                "required": true
                                                                            },
                                                                            {
                                                                                "type": "input-number",
                                                                                "name": "amount",
                                                                                "label": "贷款金额",
                                                                                "prefix": "¥"
                                                                            },
                                                                            {
                                                                                "type": "input-number",
                                                                                "name": "risk_score",
                                                                                "label": "风险评分"
                                                                            },
                                                                            {
                                                                                "type": "select",
                                                                                "name": "status",
                                                                                "label": "处理状态",
                                                                                "options": [
                                                                                    {
                                                                                        "label": "待处理",
                                                                                        "value": "pending"
                                                                                    },
                                                                                    {
                                                                                        "label": "处理中",
                                                                                        "value": "processing"
                                                                                    },
                                                                                    {
                                                                                        "label": "已完成",
                                                                                        "value": "completed"
                                                                                    }
                                                                                ]
                                                                            }
                                                                        ]
                                                                    }
                                                                }
                                                            }
                                                        ]
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            }
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "md": 4,
                        "style": {
                            "borderLeft": "1px dashed #e8e8e8",
                            "paddingLeft": "40px",
                            "height": "80%",
                            "margin": "auto 0",
                            "display": "flex",
                            "flexDirection": "column",
                            "justifyContent": "center"
                        },
                        "body": [
                            {
                                "type": "tpl",
                                "tpl": "<div style='margin-bottom: 5px;'><span style='background: #0050b3; color: #fff; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold;'>风险分析</span></div><div style='margin-bottom: 25px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #666;'>当前系统监测显示，高风险客户占比维持在合理水平，但近期有小幅上升趋势。主要集中在逾期天数超过 90 天的贷款组合中，建议重点关注该类客户的后续还款能力。</div>"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "panel",
            "title": "<div style='padding-left: 12px; border-left: 4px solid #1890ff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; color: #1d1d1f;'>风险趋势分析</div>",
            "className": "m-t-md m-b-none",
            "bodyClassName": "p-4",
            "style": {
                "boxShadow": "0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
                "borderRadius": "8px",
                "border": "1px solid #f0f0f0"
            },
            "body": {
                "type": "grid",
                "align": "middle",
                "columns": [
                    {
                        "md": 8,
                        "body": [
                            {
                                "type": "chart",
                                "api": {
                                    "url": "/api/demo/chart/risk-bar",
                                    "method": "get"
                                },
                                "height": 350,
                                "clickAction": {
                                    "actionType": "dialog",
                                    "dialog": {
                                        "title": "${event.seriesName} - ${event.name} (共${event.value}条)",
                                        "size": "xl",
                                        "actions": [
                                            {
                                                "type": "button",
                                                "label": "关闭",
                                                "actionType": "close"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "data": {
                                            "selectedSeries": "${event.seriesName}",
                                            "selectedMonth": "${event.name}"
                                        },
                                        "body": {
                                            "type": "service",
                                            "api": {
                                                "method": "get",
                                                "url": "/api/demo/bar-risk-list/high",
                                                "requestAdaptor": "const seriesMap = {'高风险':'high','中风险':'medium','低风险':'low'}; const mapKey = api.data.selectedSeries || '高风险'; const itemId = seriesMap[mapKey] || 'high'; const month = api.data.selectedMonth || '2024-07'; return { ...api, url: '/api/demo/bar-risk-list/' + itemId + '?month=' + month };"
                                            },
                                            "body": {
                                                "type": "table",
                                                "affixHeader": true,
                                                "columns": [
                                                    {
                                                        "name": "id",
                                                        "label": "ID",
                                                        "width": 60
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "name": "customer_name",
                                                        "label": "客户姓名"
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "name": "amount",
                                                        "label": "贷款金额",
                                                        "type": "tpl",
                                                        "tpl": "¥${amount | number:0,0}"
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "name": "risk_score",
                                                        "label": "风险评分",
                                                        "type": "progress",
                                                        "map": {
                                                            "*": {
                                                                "value": "${risk_score}",
                                                                "color": "${risk_score >= 80 ? 'danger' : risk_score >= 50 ? 'warning' : 'success'}"
                                                            }
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "name": "status",
                                                        "label": "处理状态",
                                                        "type": "mapping",
                                                        "map": {
                                                            "pending": "<span class='label label-warning'>待处理</span>",
                                                            "processing": "<span class='label label-info'>处理中</span>",
                                                            "completed": "<span class='label label-success'>已完成</span>"
                                                        }
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            }
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "md": 4,
                        "style": {
                            "borderLeft": "1px dashed #e8e8e8",
                            "paddingLeft": "40px",
                            "height": "80%",
                            "margin": "auto 0",
                            "display": "flex",
                            "flexDirection": "column",
                            "justifyContent": "center"
                        },
                        "body": [
                            {
                                "type": "tpl",
                                "tpl": "<div style='margin-bottom: 5px;'><span style='background: #0050b3; color: #fff; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold;'>风险分析</span></div><div style='margin-bottom: 25px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #666;'>当前系统监测显示，高风险客户占比维持在合理水平，但近期有小幅上升趋势。主要集中在逾期天数超过 90 天的贷款组合中，建议重点关注该类客户的后续还款能力。</div>"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "tpl",
            "tpl": "<div style='text-align: center; color: #999; font-size: 12px; padding: 20px 0;'>XXX 科技有限公司 © 2024</div>"
        }
    ]
}